<title>UK: United carriers upbeat on Q1 results.</title>
<headline>United carriers upbeat on Q1 results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK road transportation service firm United Carriers Group Plc said on Wednesday that first quarter results &quot;are ahead of forecast&quot;.</p>
<p>The company told shareholders at its annual general meeting that the group will continue to develop through 1997.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
